1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,500
It started with just one night.

2
00:00:02,670 --> 00:00:06,800
He told himself it was harmless.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,200
Just an hour to unwind.

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:15,200
The running shoes stayed in the corner.

5
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:19,800
The sketchbook remained blank.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,200
Then the whisper arrived.

7
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:28,800
"Tomorrow you'll feel ready."

8
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:33,200
The screen light grew colder.

9
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:37,800
Midnight turned into morning.

10
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,500
NIGHT 7

11
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:43,800
2:41 AM.

12
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:48,200
He wasn't resting.

13
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:52,800
He was hiding.

14
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:57,800
Every tomorrow had become a debt.

15
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:02,200
And the debt was growing.

16
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:06,800
The shadow was no longer outside.

17
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:11,200
It was wearing his clothes.

18
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:14,000
30 minutes later...

19
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:18,200
Another night swallowed whole.

20
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:22,800
He carried yesterday into his sleep.

21
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:27,500
Then silence.

22
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:31,800
In the mirror, he saw it clearly.

23
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:36,200
The face looking back was a ghost.

24
00:01:36,500 --> 00:01:40,200
He wasn't fighting time.

25
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:44,500
He was feeding it.

26
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:47,200
"Not tonight."

27
00:01:47,500 --> 00:01:51,200
The screen went dark.

28
00:01:51,500 --> 00:01:55,800
The loop broke.

29
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:00,200
He bent down and tied his shoes.

30
00:02:00,500 --> 00:02:04,800
The floorboards didn't creak with shame.

31
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:09,200
They creaked with weight.

32
00:02:09,500 --> 00:02:13,800
He opened the blinds.

33
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:18,800
The sun doesn't negotiate with shadows.

34
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:24,800
One step. Then another.

35
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:27,500
Wake up. It's time.

36
00:02:27,600 --> 00:02:30,000
Every night ends.
